{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is still in pre-alpha stages</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players frantically craft candy to feed a dragon while fending away gremlins, then use canon candies to fight monsters in this chaotic co-op kitchen defense game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644440/extras/bd76227644854020ee886ba6faaa56a1.avif?t=1756260348\" width=1080 height=161 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dragon needs candy to strengthen itself for the epic battle ahead. Follow recipes to craft the perfect candies within the time limit, but watch out - if it's not what the dragon requested, it'll get spat out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644440/extras/aca48f49e1ce271cc8cde910c9dabd4f.avif?t=1756260348\" width=1080 height=161 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work under pressure in this chaotic candy-making experience! Team up to make the process faster and more efficient:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melt sugar and mix in different colored dyes,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Freeze and cool the sugar to create your candy base,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape and mould the sugar into various forms,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Package your creations and deliver them to the Dragon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644440/extras/9f76f49217540bd084f4ed64b052918f.poster.avif?t=1756260348\" width=840 height=472 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644440/extras/9f76f49217540bd084f4ed64b052918f.webm?t=1756260348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644440/extras/9f76f49217540bd084f4ed64b052918f.mp4?t=1756260348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644440/extras/5fa4df247d55df679f0ddcf47c9cb642.avif?t=1756260348\" width=1080 height=161 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hungry gremlins will try to swipe ingredients from your kitchen, bowls, and machines - or even attack you directly! Strategically place ingredients on traps to keep their attention away from your candy-making chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644440/extras/5c148c004f05fc99a43bb526900ce2fc.poster.avif?t=1756260348\" width=860 height=482 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644440/extras/5c148c004f05fc99a43bb526900ce2fc.webm?t=1756260348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644440/extras/5c148c004f05fc99a43bb526900ce2fc.mp4?t=1756260348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644440/extras/536dd4b5fe26a24c599c246e80ead473.avif?t=1756260348\" width=1080 height=161 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When the dragon distracts the enemy, it's your turn to fight back! Create melted sugar cannonballs to launch at monsters, but keep an eye on the dragon's calorie counter - zero calories means you have to start all over!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644440/extras/81e55370d45cf3db844732309257ee2b.avif?t=1756260348\" width=1080 height=161 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > The monster fights back by throwing meteors to disrupt your candy crafting. Stay alert and keep your production line moving!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644440/extras/a7c27df9c3cf82ef24f4e32e0a6de871.poster.avif?t=1756260348\" width=1024 height=576 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644440/extras/a7c27df9c3cf82ef24f4e32e0a6de871.webm?t=1756260348\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644440/extras/a7c27df9c3cf82ef24f4e32e0a6de871.mp4?t=1756260348\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3644440/extras/c54362d328bc5d66cae5412b83b82df3.avif?t=1756260348\" width=1080 height=161 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple recipes,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Bosses,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple levels with new challenges,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization options</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackgrou